    "Scouting Notes": "Fastball velo isn't anything crazy, but gets really good movement and should be able to jam a lot of RHH bats.\n Slider shows flashes of being a true sweeper and could be a plus pitch.\n Changeup has shown big time flashes of moving like a reverse breaking ball. No command right now and doesn't take a ton off his FB velo.\n Curve is a fine 4th pitch, that he used as his secondary in college. Guessing Brewers will change that.\n Decent command, comes and goes.\n Really good landing spot with the Brewers, can see him developing well in the system.",
